              <div className="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
                <h3 className="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-gray-900">Platform Rules & Guidelines</h3>
                <div className="space-y-4">
                  <div>
                    <h4 className="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">1. User Eligibility</h4>
                    <ul className="space-y-1 text-gray-700 text-sm ml-4">
                      <li>• Must be a current Thapar University student or faculty member</li>
                      <li>• Valid Thapar email address required for registration</li>
                      <li>• One account per person only</li>
                      <li>• Minimum age requirement: 17 years</li>
                    </ul>
                  </div>
                  
                  <div>
                    <h4 className="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">2. Acceptable Use</h4>
                    <ul className="space-y-1 text-gray-700 text-sm ml-4">
                      <li>• Use platform only for legitimate buying/selling within college community</li>
                      <li>• Provide accurate product descriptions and photos</li>
                      <li>• Respect other users and maintain professional communication</li>
                      <li>• Report suspicious activity or policy violations</li>
                    </ul>
                  </div>

                  <div>
                    <h4 className="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">3. Prohibited Items</h4>
                    <div className="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded p-3">
                      <ul className="space-y-1 text-red-700 text-sm">
                        <li>• Illegal or controlled substances</li>
                        <li>• Weapons, explosives, or dangerous items</li>
                        <li>• Counterfeit or pirated goods</li>
                        <li>• Adult content or inappropriate materials</li>
                        <li>• Live animals or perishable food items</li>
                        <li>• Items that violate copyright or intellectual property</li>
                        <li>• Academic dishonesty materials (answer keys, completed assignments)</li>
                      </ul>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div>
                    <h4 className="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">4. Payment & Fees</h4>
                    <ul className="space-y-1 text-gray-700 text-sm ml-4">
                      <li>• ₹5 non-refundable fee required for each product listing</li>
                      <li>• Payment must be completed before product upload</li>
                      <li>• Platform does not handle buyer-seller transactions</li>
                      <li>• Users responsible for their own payment disputes</li>
                    </ul>
                  </div>

                  <div>
                    <h4 className="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">5. Content Ownership & Rights</h4>
                    <ul className="space-y-1 text-gray-700 text-sm ml-4">
                      <li>• Users retain ownership of uploaded content (photos, descriptions)</li>
                      <li>• Users grant thaparMART license to display content for platform operation</li>
                      <li>• Platform may remove content that violates terms</li>
                      <li>• Users responsible for ensuring they have rights to uploaded content</li>
                    </ul>
                  </div>

                  <div>
                    <h4 className="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">6. Account Termination</h4>
                    <ul className="space-y-1 text-gray-700 text-sm ml-4">
                      <li>• Platform reserves right to terminate accounts for policy violations</li>
                      <li>• Users may delete their accounts at any time</li>
                      <li>• Terminated accounts forfeit unused payment tokens</li>
                      <li>• Account data retained for 30 days after termination</li>
                    </ul>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div className="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg p-6">
                <h3 className="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-blue-800">Privacy & Data Protection</h3>
                <ul className="space-y-2 text-blue-700 text-sm">
                  <li>• Personal information used only for platform operation and user communication</li>
                  <li>• Contact details shared with buyers/sellers only when necessary for transactions</li>
                  <li>• Data stored securely with encryption and regular backups</li>
                  <li>• Users can request data deletion upon account termination</li>
                  <li>• Platform complies with applicable data protection regulations</li>
                  <li>• Third-party services (Razorpay, AWS) used for payments and file storage</li>
                </ul>
              </div>

              <div className="bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 rounded-lg p-6">
                <h3 className="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-yellow-800">Limitation of Liability</h3>
                <p className="text-yellow-700 text-sm mb-3">
                  thaparMART is a platform that connects buyers and sellers. We do not guarantee the quality, 
                  safety, or legality of items listed, the truth or accuracy of listings, or the ability of 
                  buyers and sellers to complete transactions.
                </p>
                <ul className="space-y-2 text-yellow-700 text-sm">
                  <li>• Platform not responsible for transaction disputes between users</li>
                  <li>• Users assume full responsibility for their interactions and transactions</li>
                  <li>• Platform provides mediation support but cannot guarantee resolution</li>
                  <li>• Use platform at your own risk and exercise appropriate caution</li>
                </ul>
              </div>

              <div className="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
                <h3 className="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-gray-900">Contact & Updates</h3>
                <div className="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                  <div>
                    <h4 className="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Questions or Concerns:</h4>
                    <p className="text-gray-700 text-sm mb-2">Use our contact form for any questions about these terms.</p>
                    <p className="text-gray-700 text-sm">Response time: 24-48 hours</p>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <h4 className="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Terms Updates:</h4>
                    <p className="text-gray-700 text-sm mb-2">Terms may be updated periodically.</p>
                    <p className="text-gray-700 text-sm">Users will be notified of significant changes.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div className="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-gray-300">
                  <p className="text-gray-600 text-xs">
                    Last updated: January 2025 | By using thaparMART, you agree to these terms and conditions.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>

          {/* FAQ */}
          <section id="faq" className="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-8">
            <h2 className="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-900 border-b pb-4">❓ Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            <div className="space-y-4">
              {[
                {
                  q: "How long do my product listings stay active?",
                  a: "Product listings automatically expire after 2.5 days to keep the marketplace fresh and relevant."
                },
                {
                  q: "Can I edit my product after posting?",
                  a: "Yes, you have a 1-hour window after posting to edit product details (excluding images)."
                },
                {
                  q: "Is my personal information safe?",
                  a: "Yes, we only share necessary contact information between buyers and sellers. All data is securely stored."
                },
                {
                  q: "What if I face issues with a transaction?",
                  a: "Contact our support team through the contact page. We mediate disputes and ensure fair resolution."
                },
                {
                  q: "Can faculty members also use the platform?",
                  a: "Yes, verified faculty members can register and participate in the marketplace."
                }
              ].map((faq, index) => (
                <div key={index} className="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-4 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                  <h4 className="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">{faq.q}</h4>
                  <p className="text-gray-700 text-sm">{faq.a}</p>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  );
};

